。‘扑腾’老婆子身形一歪，被那一巴掌扇的侧倒在地上，脑袋登时嗡嗡的作响，在地上抽搐几下，便晕了过去。另外两名老婆子愣了，没想到双腿被废了，还能如此厉害。“你们算是什么东西，敢对我大呼小叫。”眼神扫视另外两名老婆子，冰冷的声音带着不容置疑的霸道。剩下的两名老婆子迎上蓝雅心中一沉，在蓝雅的眼神下，噤若寒蝉，同时心中知道，这二小姐比以前还要厉害。“愣着做什么，还不抬我去大厅。”冰冷的喝声带着不容置疑的命令。两位老婆子一听，立即犹如被释放一样，上前抬着凳子，朝着大厅而去。后方的沉香临走时还狠狠的踹了几脚晕倒的老婆子，哼，让你得意，踹死你！正厅，主位之上的沐之航一脸的怒气，左边位置上，大夫人董玥和大小姐穆乐清心中得意，这次老爷绝对不会放过那个死丫头。后方站着的二夫人王莹因为身上中了一剑，此时站着的都感觉虚浮，面色苍白入雪，身体几乎全部靠在丫鬟身上。整个大厅很静，蓝雅的椅子被抬到门口之时，就发现正厅内的气氛，心思沉着，看来这一关很不好过。两位两婆子将椅子放到大厅，随之推到董玥的身后，低头在董玥的耳边嘀咕了一下。董玥阴沉着脸，看着中间的人，冷哼一声，断了腿，看她今后还能出什么幺蛾子！蓝雅抬眼稍稍打量周围的人，虽然从未见过面，她大概也能猜出谁是谁，这种场面在古装戏里很常见，所有光看架势就知道。没人说话，蓝雅也不说话，稍稍观察沐之航，他那脸上的怒气很明显，下方大夫人董玥和穆乐清幸灾乐祸的样子，全然的收进她的眼底。最后方脸色苍白如雪的女子便是二夫人王莹，也就是穆青颜的亲娘。“我怎么生了你这么个女儿，穆家的脸都让你给丢进了！”正厅上，沐之航终于开口了。蓝雅垂着脑袋，依旧不语，她不知道要说什么，也不知道该如何说，在这里，她没有逞强的本事，更没有本钱，在一个人生地不熟的古代，对于一个断了双腿的人被丢弃只有死亡。她对丫鬟婆子再厉害，也不能对沐之航展现半分，如今她所做的只有一个字忍，生命从来一次，她不能死，也不想死！“我穆家的脸都让你给丢尽了！”沐之航大手拍着桌子，发出巨大的声音。王莹心中惊骇，撑起身子，弯腰就跪在地上：“老爷，这真的不是青颜的错……”对于王莹的做法，蓝雅有些惊讶，眼神闪了闪，还是未多说什么。“哼，妹妹这样说什么意思？不是青颜的错，难道是当今狂王的错？”董玥阴阳怪气的声音响起，同时轻蔑的撇着跪在地上的女人。新文新气象，本文有宠有虐，还有聪明宝宝，女主一步一步变强，爱情感人至深。", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/shenyiqifei/10.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "Adding fuel to the fire, \"Ah... my head.\" The old woman covered her forehead, and a piece of blood fell on the ground along her fingers: \"Ah... blood, it's bleeding, you bitch, I'm going to kill you!\" The old woman became angry and rushed towards Lanya. Lanya raised her hand, and when she was about to throw herself down, she slapped her forehead hard. The old woman's body tilted, and she fell to the ground due to the slap. Her head started to buzz, she twitched a few times on the ground, and then she fainted. The other two old women were stunned. They didn't expect that they could be so powerful after their legs were crippled. \"Who do you think you are? You dare to yell at me.\" His eyes glanced at the other two old ladies, and his cold voice was undeniably domineering. The remaining two old ladies met Lanya and their hearts sank. Under Lanya's eyes, they remained silent. At the same time, they knew in their hearts that these two young ladies were even more powerful than before. \"What are you doing here? Why don't you carry me to the hall?\" The cold voice carried an unquestionable order. When the two old ladies heard this, they immediately felt as if they were being released. They stepped forward and carried the stools towards the hall. Before leaving, Chen Xiang from the rear kicked the old woman who fainted several times. Hum, I'll make you proud and kick you to death! In the main hall, Mu Zhihang, who was on the throne, had an angry face. On the left, the eldest lady Dong Yue and the eldest daughter Mu Yueqing were proud. This time, the master would never let that dead girl go. The second lady, Wang Ying, who was standing behind her, was hit by a sword. Everyone who was standing now felt weak, her face was as pale as snow, and her body was almost leaning against the maid. The entire hall was very quiet. When Lanya's chair was carried to the door, she noticed that the atmosphere in the main hall was calm. It seemed that this test was very difficult. The two wives put the chairs in the hall, pushed them behind Dong Yue, lowered their heads and whispered in Dong Yue's ears. Dong Yue looked at the person in the middle with a gloomy face, snorted coldly, and broke her leg. Let's see what trouble she can do in the future! Lan Ya raised her eyes and looked at the people around her. Even though she had never met before, she could probably guess who was who. This kind of scene is very common in costume dramas. You can tell just by looking at the posture. No one spoke, not even Lanya. After observing Mu Zhihang for a moment, the anger on his face was obvious. The gloating looks of Madam Dong Yue and Mu Yueqing below were completely reflected in her eyes. The woman at the end with a face as pale as snow is the second wife Wang Ying, Mu Qingyan's biological mother. \"Why did I give birth to a daughter like you? You have made the Mu family's face even worse!\" Mu Zhihang finally spoke in the main hall. Lan Ya lowered her head and remained silent. She didn't know what to say or how to say it. Here, she didn't have the ability to be brave, let alone the capital. In an ancient place where she was unfamiliar with life, the only way for a person with broken legs to be abandoned was death. No matter how powerful she is to the maid and mother-in-law, she can't show half of it to Mu Zhihang. Now all she has to do is endure. She only lives once. She can't die, and she doesn't want to die! \"My Mu family has been completely disgraced by you!\" Mu Zhihang slapped the table with his big hands and made a loud sound. Wang Ying was horrified. She pushed herself up, bent down and knelt on the ground: \"Master, this is really not Qingyan's fault...\" Lan Ya was a little surprised by Wang Ying's actions, her eyes flashed, but she didn't say anything more. \"Hmph, what do you mean by this, sister? It's not Qingyan's fault, but the fault of the current mad king?\" Dong Yue's sinister voice sounded, and at the same time he looked at the woman kneeling on the ground with contempt. New text, new atmosphere, this text is both pampering and abusive, and there is also a smart baby. The heroine becomes stronger step by step, and the love is deeply touching.", "title_en": "Chapter 10"}